#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The user is not the super-user, and I<gid> does not match the effective "
#| "group ID or saved set-group-ID of the calling process."
msgid ""
"The calling process is not privileged (does not have the B<CAP_SETGID> "
"capability in its user namespace), and I<gid> does not match the real group "
"ID or saved set-group-ID of the calling process."
msgstr ""
"O usuário não é o superusuário, e I<gid> não combina o ID do grupo efetivo "
"ou armazenada do processo solicitante."

